This Criminal Petition has been filed by the petitioner/accused seeking to quash the proceedings in S.C. No.569 of 2024 on the file of the Special Sessions Judge for Fast Tracking the Cases relating to Atrocities against Women-cum-XIII Additional District Judge, Ranga Reddy District at L.B.Nagar,
for the offences punishable under Sections 376(2)(n), 417, 493 and 506 of the Indian Penal Code,
1860.
